    "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Exercise real delivery states instead of fabricated rows**\n\nThis parameterized test feeds three fabricated `AsyncJob` objects directly into the formatter, so every row exercises the same field-copying path rather than distinct lifecycle branches. In particular, `AsyncJobManager` does not enqueue an async result after cancellation (`register()` returns from both cancellation paths before `#enqueueDelivery`), meaning the `cancelled` row can pass while extensions never receive such a message. Drive completed/failed states through the manager and either test a real cancellation delivery or remove that unsupported case.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L287-L291](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/blob/874fe1f20bc5f906812ff52c0a6a5698a59c191e/AGENTS.md#L287-L291)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
